      "contextFingerprint": "5a8a8dd34f64ef0875faed2f72505f473406148eab221d9d18d59f9e5fb347c9",
      "sourceText": "`serial_comm` 直接把 `linear.x、linear.y、angular.z` 写入协议字段，按周期发送，没有用 JointState再换方向。MCU需核对四件事：线速度是否按云台系接收；机械相对 yaw 的零位与正负号；m/s与rad/s的单位；角速度是否已经包含自旋、是否会重复相加。当前没有核对MCU执行代码或实物响应，不能把上位机约定写成下位机已正确实现。",
      "translatedText": "`serial_comm` Directly write `linear.x、linear.y、angular.z` into the protocol field and send it periodically, without using JointState to change direction again\\. The MCU needs to verify four things: whether the linear velocity is received in the gimbal frame; the zero position and sign of the mechanical relative yaw; the units of m/s and rad/s; whether the angular velocity already includes spin and whether it will be added repeatedly\\. Currently, the MCU execution code or physical response has not been verified, so the host computer convention cannot be written as already correctly implemented on the lower computer\\.",
