      "translatedText": "`max_height=6.0`The window of  is very wide\\. If points such as high crossbeams pass the upstream and height\\-difference filtering, they will be projected onto the 2D map, and even if the vehicle could originally pass underneath, they may still form obstacle outlines\\. The height to be retained should be checked against the chassis, the gimbal motion envelope, and suspended structures; it must not be treated as a model dimension\\. At the same time, one must not merely lower the upper limit and thereby miss the only visible part of the obstacle\\.",
