      "sourceText": "1. 学 `nullptr`：写两个重载函数，分别接收 `int` 和 `int*`，观察 `0`、`NULL`、`nullptr` 的区别。\n2. 学 `enum class`：把普通枚举换成枚举类，看看哪些隐式转换被禁止。\n3. 学智能指针：先写一个提前 `return` 的手动 `new/delete` 例子，再改成 `unique_ptr`。\n4. 学 Lambda：分别用按值捕获和按引用捕获，观察外部变量是否变化。\n5. 学 `std::function`：把多个不同 lambda 放进同一个 `vector`，统一执行。\n6. 学并发：让两个 1 秒等待任务先顺序执行，再放进两个线程中执行，对比耗时。",
      "translatedText": "1. Learn `nullptr`: Write two overloaded functions, receiving `int` and `int*` respectively, and observe the differences between `0` , `NULL` , and `nullptr`\\.\n2. Learn `enum class`: Replace a plain enum with an enum class, and see which implicit conversions are prohibited\\.\n3. Learn smart pointers: First write a manual `return` example that `new/delete` early, then change it to `unique_ptr`\\.\n4. Learn Lambda: Use capture by value and capture by reference respectively, and observe whether external variables change\\.\n5. Learn `std::function`: Put multiple different lambdas into the same `vector` and execute them uniformly\\.\n6. Learn concurrency: Have two tasks that each wait 1 second execute sequentially first, then put them into two threads and execute them, and compare the elapsed time\\.",
